          "type": "actions",
          "text": "ID(FIE073) will deliver a written plan covering functional and technical design, staffing, timeframe, budget, and market plan by two weeks."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#1",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "Ed will coordinate with Christine to discuss cost and the sales plan as part of preparing the overall plan."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#2",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "ID(FIE073) did not understand the project goal and believed the project was a different product, indicating a scope/goal misalignment."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#3",
          "type": "problems",
          "text": "There is no written project plan or budget yet, and documentation is missing to present to management."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#4",
          "type": "decisions",
          "text": "The group decided that the project will focus on designing a remote control for television and will start with that remote control as the first product."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#5",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "The project manager will send a copy of the slides to all attendees at the conclusion of the meeting."
        },
        {
          "item_key": "IS1008a#6",
          "type": "actions",
          "text": "ID(FIE073) will identify additional contributors from marketing, technical, and administration for the plan and inform PM."
